title: WarehouseExt
---
<<set_reputation>>
<<play_music "DefaultBGMusic">>
Narrator: Nisaea carefully follows instructions toward the town's edge.
Narrator:The stars overhead brilliantly light her path as crickets keep her company.
Narrator:She had never thought of how different the sky would look when stationary as opposed to the gentle sway of the midnight pool she calls home.
Narrator:At home, there were twice as many blurred and droukit stars, but on land, they sparkled in stagnant isolation.
Narrator:Soon enough, she was outside the warehouse. Her skin prickled like a plucked chicken from more than the cold as she took in the environment.

<<reveal_object "Nisaea-FullBody">>
Nisaea: <i>Maybe I should look around inside first?</i>
  <<jump INT>>
//this error is citing how there is a difference between the art Milo drew vs Monica. Milo is Warehouse Exterior (WarehouseExt.) and Monica's is Warehouse Int. in the script. I'm unsure if it's labeled as such in the asset folder)
