===
title: SSkCT
---
Narrator:An impeccable pelt, colored in shades of gray and speckled with symmetrical dots on a rusty meat hook. It is unclear how this skin was obtained. 
Narrator:It is difficult to tell if it is a Selkie skin or a huge seal molt. It is too far away to bear a discernable scent, and Nisaea cannot advance without disturbing the doctor.
Nisaea:"Regardless of how this was acquired, it makes one prematurely visit lunch."
<<hide_object "RealSelkieSkin">>
<<if visited ("SSkCF")>>
<<if visited ("WVC")>>
  <<reveal_object "Doctor-Interactable">>
<<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: SSkCF
---
Narrator:A carefully encased pelt, colored in shades of grey and asymmetrical dots that do not completely cover the fur. It is unclear how this skin was obtained.
Narrator:It is difficult to tell if it is a Selkie pup skin or a large juvenile seal molt. The case prevents any further identification without Nisaea advancing and disturbing the doctor.
Nisaea:"How unique. An incomplete pattern. I hope the creature it comes from is ok..."
<<hide_object "FakeSelkieSkin">>
<<if visited ("SSkCT")>>
<<if visited ("WVC")>>
  <<reveal_object "Doctor-Interactable">>
<<endif>>
<<endif>>
