title: WVC
---
Narrator: A tiny glass vial of shed whiskers, meticulously kept. They do not appear to be plucked and have similar patterns, suggesting that they are from the same subject.
Nisaea: "Peculiar. What need would one have with whiskers? They are quite long as well. I suspect an adult or a selkie."
<<hide_object "WhiskersVial">>
<<if visited ("SSkCF")>>
<<if visited ("SSkCT")>>
